 Society Membership Among Medical Students. JAMA Netw Open. Jun 1 2021;4(6):e2110730. doi: 10.1001/jamanetworkopen.2021.10730 [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 79. Boatright D, Ross D, O’Connor P, Moore E, Nunez-Smith M. Racial Disparities in Medical Student Membership in the Alpha Omega Alpha Honor Society. JAMA Intern Med. May 1 2017;177(5):659–665. doi: 10.1001/jamainternmed.2016.9623 [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 80. Ross DA, Boatright D, Nunez-Smith M, Jordan A, Chekroud A, Moore EZ. Differences in words used to describe racial and gender groups in Medical Student Performance Evaluations. PLoS One. 2017;12(8):e0181659. doi: 10.1371/journal.pone.0181659 [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 81. Low D, Pollack SW, Liao ZC, et al. Racial/Ethnic Disparities in Clinical Grading in Medical School. Teach Learn Med. Oct-Dec 2019;31(5):487–496. doi: 10.1080/10401334.2019.1597724 [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 82. McKenzie B, Majmudar G, Chin-Loy K. Attitudes and experiences of medical students Underrepresented in Medicine (UIM) considering applying to ophthalmology residency. 2021: 83. Rubright JD, Jodoin M, Barone MA. Examining Demographics, Prior Academic Performance, and United States Medical Licensing Examination Scores. Acad Med. Mar 2019;94(3):364–370. doi: 10.1097/ACM.0000000000002366 [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 84. Siatkowski RM, Mian SI, Culican SM, et al. Probability of Success in the Ophthalmology Residency Match: Three-Year Outcomes Analysis of San Francisco Matching Program Data. J Acad Ophthalmol. Jan 2018;10(1):e150–e157. doi: 10.1055/s-0038-1673675 [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 85. Nallasamy S, Uhler T, Nallasamy N, Tapino PJ, Volpe NJ. Ophthalmology resident selection: current trends in selection criteria and improving the process. Ophthalmology. May 2010;117(5):1041–7. doi: 10.1016/j.ophtha.2009.07.034 [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Sch